    <bpmn:startEvent id="START" name="Demand raised on the Single Front Door"/>
    <bpmn:task id="IN_01" name="IN-01 Complete Required Demand Submission Information">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 1. Business need, request type, impacted markets, sponsor, required date, initial effort, funding position, dependencies and supporting evidence. Team: Requestor. Tool: Single Front Door (Pega). Status: C2. Confidence: supported (Single Front Door, DAM triage and Demand Board detail follows the booklet; the independent WS4 original is not established, so nothing here is C1.)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="IN_02" name="IN-02 Raise Demand on Single Front Door">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 1. Submit the demand on the Single Front Door (G0); merges OFF-011 and DM-01. Team: Requestor. Tool: Single Front Door (Pega). Output: G0. Status: C2. Confidence: supported (Single Front Door, DAM triage and Demand Board detail follows the booklet; the independent WS4 original is not established, so nothing here is C1.)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="IN_03" name="IN-03 Generate Demand Reference">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 1. Register the demand for tracking. Team: Demand Assurance Manager (DAM). Tool: Pega. Output: Demand reference. Status: I. Confidence: provisional (Single Front Door, DAM triage and Demand Board detail follows the booklet; the independent WS4 original is not established, so nothing here is C1.)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="IN_04" name="IN-04 DAM Completeness Check">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 1. Check that the submission is complete. Team: Demand Assurance Manager (DAM). Tool: Pega. Status: C2. Confidence: supported (Single Front Door, DAM triage and Demand Board detail follows the booklet; the independent WS4 original is not established, so nothing here is C1.)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_18" name="Demand complete?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="IN_05" name="IN-05 DAM Triage and Classification">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 1. Triage the demand and confirm its classification and route; merges OFF-013, OFF-014 and DM-02. Team: Demand Assurance Manager (DAM). Tool: Pega. Status: C2. Confidence: supported (Single Front Door, DAM triage and Demand Board detail follows the booklet; the independent WS4 original is not established, so nothing here is C1.)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="IN_06" name="IN-06 Identify Impacted Functions">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 1. Identify the impacted NW functions and verticals. Team: Demand Assurance Manager (DAM). Tool: Pega. Status: C2. Confidence: supported (Single Front Door, DAM triage and Demand Board detail follows the booklet; the independent WS4 original is not established, so nothing here is C1.)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_19" name="Cross-functional?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="IN_07" name="IN-07 Cross-functional Handshake">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 1. Handshake with other NW function PS or vertical SPOC for cross-functional demand. Team: NW Vertical Function SPOC. Tool: . Status: C2. Confidence: supported (Single Front Door, DAM triage and Demand Board detail follows the booklet; the independent WS4 original is not established, so nothing here is C1.)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Triage_outcome" name="Triage outcome?"/>
    <bpmn:task id="FA.01.01" name="FA.01.01 Accept Request and Initiate EDM Allocation">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 2. Accept the request and initiate EDM allocation. Team: Market Delivery Manager (MDM). Tool: . Status: C1. Confidence: supported (FA activities confirmed against NSE E2E Project Delivery Process_2025 and RACI; local role variations require market confirmation. Activity owners placed per role names given in the review, to check against the RACI.)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="FA.01.02" name="FA.01.02 EDM Appointment">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 2. Appoint the Engineering Delivery Manager. Team: Market Delivery Manager (MDM). Tool: . Status: C1. Confidence: supported (FA activities confirmed against NSE E2E Project Delivery Process_2025 and RACI; local role variations require market confirmation. Activity owners placed per role names given in the review, to check against the RACI.)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="FA.02.01" name="FA.02.01 Team and Solution Authority Allocation">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 2. Allocate the delivery team and the Solution Authority. Team: Engineering Delivery Manager (EDM). Tool: . Status: C1. Confidence: supported (FA activities confirmed against NSE E2E Project Delivery Process_2025 and RACI; local role variations require market confirmation. Activity owners placed per role names given in the review, to check against the RACI.)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="IA_01" name="IA-01 Functional Impact Assessment">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 2. NW vertical teams and other NW functions assess impact (from DM-05, DM-06). Team: Team in NSE Vertical. Tool: . Status: C2. Confidence: supported (FA activities confirmed against NSE E2E Project Delivery Process_2025 and RACI; local role variations require market confirmation. Activity owners placed per role names given in the review, to check against the RACI.)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
